Z||000000||Dan86gt3.8||04-04-2000||04:23 PM||||Yes I have a 3.8 with the 4t60e and was wondering if it would perform better with a getrag, because I know there are some getrags that have like 3.73 final drives, and even one with a 4.10's.  I was thinking that sinse the 4t60e came in granny cars like the olds and buicks that the gearing might not be agressives as it could be.  I know there is a shift kit made by bm for the 4t60e they sell it in jegs.  Does anyone have a stock 3.8 with a 5 speed getrag and have a time for it?  has a race between a auto and manual 3.8 ever took place?  And also is there a 110 speed limiter on the 4t60e, I know when in park it has like a 3500 rev limmiter that kicks in.  I think cutter said that was internall though, not in the electronics.  Does anyone have info on 4tg60e gearing vs. getrag gearing?  does anyone have a 3.8 non s/c with a manual??? or know of any sites?  well just curious about this leme know if you have any onfo or were I can get info.||||reg||5
